Conclusion: same-host containers don't connect via the public DHT (shared outbound NAT; hairpin). Resolved by the udx-on-bridge + bare-metal probes -> the fix is firewalled:false direct connect on the flat bridge (see journey/phase-1-peers-connect.md).
